{"parse": {"title": "TTL-02", "pageid": 28151, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTL-01\" title=\"TTL-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTL-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/TTL-03\" title=\"TTL-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTL</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AD.A4.E9.B8.9F.E6.88.96.E7.81.B0.E7.99.BD.E7.8A.AC\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"孤鸟或灰白犬\">孤鸟或灰白犬</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 孤鸟或灰白犬</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Island, or a Gray Dog</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1770302</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门前的两人面面相觑，惊疑不定的情绪迅速地泛滥开来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这场面显然令深入简出的专栏作者无法应付。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>糟糕……我说错了什么吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>一定是因为我太过沉浸在自己的世界里，怠慢了这位远道而来的先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我甚至想不起来敲门声响起了多少次，二、三、五……不，也许更早。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>这扇门的质地并不好，声音也比普通的木门沉闷得多，或许我应该写信给丹尼希女士，请她取用一部分稿费，替我购置一盏门铃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>可是，到岛上来的路程并不方便，除了邮差先生，再没有人乐意到这儿来了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的思绪越飘越远，一声刻意的咳嗽将她扯了回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>直入正题吧，马库斯小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>根据我们的调查，你已经很久没有离开弗兰南群岛了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306523.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306523.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>是……是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>坦白说，你的行动路径为我们的登记工作造成了不少困扰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>尚未登记的神秘学家大多出没于皇家博览会，或是爱丁堡艺术节之类的场所……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>内莉·梅尔巴爵士美妙的歌喉响彻在欧澳之间的大小剧院，高地运动会更是每年都能吸引数以万计的观众与运动员们投身其中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>哪怕是我再愚钝的同僚，也愿意花上几天的时间为之庆祝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>无数美好的象征都在这片土壤中发生着——恕我直言，马库斯小姐，你应该去更大的地方看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306521.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306521.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接连不断的名词从夸夸其谈的口中涌出，令马库斯一阵头昏耳热。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>或许这位先生不慎感染了热病？还是我在岛上呆了太久，外面的人们都是如此的……健谈吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>冷静点，马库斯，你能应付好这一切的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她握紧拳头，小声地为自己打气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>目前的情况似乎能对应上《社交礼仪入门守则》上的建议……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>绅士们往往不会直接承认自己对于某个话题的无知，他们会巧妙地施展谈话技巧，将话题引导向双方都更熟悉的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>而对于这位先生，最适合的话题应该是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我明白了——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抬起头来，在对方滔滔不绝罗列的间隙，抓住了难得的救命稻草。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>先生，我听说过您们。当我还在福利院的时候，听说了许多关于基金会的故事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>你们似乎一直在收集神秘学家……尤其是孩子们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>而从来不顾他们的个人意愿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>孩子们都说，他们亲眼看见基金会的人抓走了他们的朋友……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她还想说些什么，对方的脸色逐渐晦暗。遗憾的是，这并不属于《社交礼仪》上所写的任何一种走向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>终于，这是马库斯能够读懂的“一页”了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>你一定是在开玩笑，马库斯女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>这是个好时代，每一个人都很重视个人的进步。理性，科学，自由……当然，还有一点儿与潮流相匹配的幽默感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>尽管我能理解你过于进步的幽默感，但如此令人匪夷所思的藐视与污蔑仍是不适宜的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>——尤其是当你尚未办理完基金会的入职流程的时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>不不……这是在罗马尼亚发生的事，我想它与您和您同僚们的办事处无关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>很遗憾，书上的办法无法适用于所有的场景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但某些被无意忽略的话语显然对马库斯造成了更大的创伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>等等，调查员先生……您刚刚说的是，加入基金会？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>当然，这有什么问题吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他理了理衣襟，像是在宣布一件稀松平常的人事任命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306521.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306521.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我、我……我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>马库斯小姐，你似乎有点心率过快？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>我理解你的狼狈，许多新同事都经历过类似的情况。但别担心，基金会拥有完备的医疗救助体系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>调查员先生，请您停一停……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她终于找准机会，颤抖着张了张口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>多亏了您的帮助，我已经完全理解了基金会的重要性与它在人们之中的受欢迎程度，也非常感谢您的邀请……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>但如您所见，我现在手头上还有一些尚未完成的工作，它们关乎着我的……理想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯回过头去，眼巴巴地望着门后那一方小小的写作天地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>噢，理想——！马库斯小姐，你的理想是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员老练地点了点头，似乎对此并不意外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306518.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306518.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306518.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306518.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306518.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306518.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306518.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306518.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我、我希望能让更多人了解弗兰南群岛，能对神秘学世界不再陌生，能……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>很远大的理想——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他顺势走上前来，朝着无边的大海扬起手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>马库斯小姐，别局限在这座岛！看看远方，看看这个伟大的世界，有多少神秘事件等着我们去探索，去发掘——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>这也正是基金会的理想！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>可别告诉我您不想为人类的福祉、为世界的进步献上一份力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>不……这确实和我的想法颇为相近。只是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她张了张嘴，把没说完的话咽了回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方仔细地打量了一番对方，像是猛然醒悟了什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>噢！当然，当然——您是一位知名的作家，一定有无数的读者们盼望着您接下来的精彩故事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯急忙摆了摆手，一抹显眼的红从耳根漫到了耳尖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>不……我还只是个不成熟的专栏作者，还有许多需要改进的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>你可能还不清楚，基金会保存了世界上各地区的重要书目，不论是人类的，还是神秘学家的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>加入基金会后，只需要填写查阅申请表格，通过相关负责人的审批，再顺利推进到行政复议阶段——你就能轻松地阅览它们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>对于任何一位作家来说，基金会都应该是无法拒绝的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>只是……还有许多人都好奇着弗兰南群岛发生的故事……那些我还没来得及写下的故事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>更重要的是，岛上的杜卡特先生、马歇尔先生、唐纳德先生……都期待着我能讲述更多关于他们的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我的工作还没有结束……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她大口喘着气，像是终于挤出了堵在胸口的磐石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他皱了皱眉，毫不掩饰自己的失望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>好吧，我会如实地将你的选择向上汇报——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>选择……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯陷入了慌乱，又一次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>不不不，我还没能做出决定……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我只是希望您能给我一些时间，请您相信我，这不会太久的……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>近乎哀求的语气显著地打动了这位形式主义者的心。他郑重地清了清嗓子，大发慈悲地开口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>好吧，但你得清楚，基金会的入职名额相当有限。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>如果没赶上好时候，我想你得在办事处门口等上一段时间了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>如果你决定好了，就将信件寄到埃利安锡尔——不用写具体的地址，写上基金会就好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方将一封印有灰白格子的信件塞到了马库斯手里，头也不回地离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>留在原地的人身形摇摇欲坠，终于瘫坐在地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那封空白的信件被紧紧地攥在手里，徒增无数烦恼的褶皱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>基金会的名气很高，他们之间有许多像我这样的神秘学家，这能为我的取材带来许多的帮助……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>调查员先生说得不错，想必基金会中有更多介绍神秘学的书籍……当然，人类相关的书目肯定也不在少数！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>可《白日梦邮报》的读者们同样在期待着我，期待着弗兰南群岛的故事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>丹尼希女士也对我的文章寄予厚望……如果贸然离开，我一定会令更多人失望……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>目前的《弗兰南群岛史》也吸引了不少人的关注，他们想必对神秘学现象也颇感兴趣……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>啊……有人能救救我吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>微弱的呼救声并未传出太远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>甚至没能盖过一旁又再响起的敲门声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咚咚——！咚咚——！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>嘿，马库斯——！你终于醒过来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>我们还以为你又睡在了门外呢——第十三次！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>而且……你、还是睁着眼睛的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一道声音适时地为马库斯的现状作了更进一步的补充。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>很正常，伙计们……我们的小马库斯擅长这个，把自己整个都塞进那些四四方方的匣子里，是叫什么来着……噢，“阅读”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>啊、你们好，马歇尔先生、唐纳德先生……还有杜卡特先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>真让人伤心，马库斯，难道你没有听见我们赶过来的脚步声吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼角的余光悄悄地瞥了瞥对方三人漂浮在半空、近乎透明的双脚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……我很抱歉，先生们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>别再卖关子了，老杜卡特，快把那封信给马库斯——这说不准又是读者们寄过来的信，他们又该把马库斯夸得天花乱坠啦～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又一封信件被递到了马库斯的眼前，上面印着她更加熟悉的图案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>放心吧，马库斯。我们遵守了和你的约定，在上次的那位邮差先生从船上跌进水里、变成落汤鸡之后……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-515401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马歇尔：</div><div>我们就再也没有出现在任何一位新邮差的面前了——胆小鬼唐纳德可以作证！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>我……他们没有吓到我～马歇尔也没有朝着他们做鬼脸……但那些邮差们还是离得远远的，把信扔下就走了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-515301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">唐纳德：</div><div>他们在害怕什么吗……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>人们当然害怕这儿，他们对这儿几乎一无所知……正因如此，我们需要《弗兰南群岛史》，需要借它来解除外界的人对我们的偏见……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>这正是我们的小马库斯的努力成果！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>怎么了，小马库斯……你看上去可不太高兴？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-515501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜卡特：</div><div>信封上沾了什么奇怪的东西吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>这……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……这是《弗兰南群岛史》第十五节的退稿信。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTL-02"}}